    # m 1lksdlc "I would wonder if you'd forgotten about me, or if you didn't want to spend time with me anymore."
    m 1lksdlc "Me preguntaría si te habías olvidado de mí o si ya no querías pasar tiempo conmigo."

# game/script-topics.rpy:10157
